Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 会议是为什么乱
Segment #2   [00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,400] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 你看我现在问你这个问题
Segment #3   [00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,000] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 我问你会议是为什么乱
Segment #4   [00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:10,320] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 11 | Text: 我要给你们讲一个过去现在和未来
Segment #5   [00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,440] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 我问这个话的时候在什么时候
Segment #6   [00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,100] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 我问会议是为什么乱
Segment #7   [00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,080] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 1  | Text: 现在
Segment #8   [00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,480] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 2  | Text: 在现在
Segment #9   [00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,880] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 我问的问题是什么
Segment #10  [00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,780] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 会议是为什么乱
Segment #11  [00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,280] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 我问的问题是不是在过去
Segment #12  [00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:23,600] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 1  | Text: 是
Segment #13  [00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,540] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 我只要去想过去的问题的时候
Segment #14  [00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,180] | Elapsed:  11.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 那我肯定就要发火了
Segment #15  [00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,380] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就要很生气
Segment #16  [00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,940] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们这些人领了我的工资
Segment #17  [00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:33,480] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 11 | Text: 花了我大量的人力精力物力
Segment #18  [00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,280] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 花了这么多的钱
Segment #19  [00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,800] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 10 | Text: 你们连个会议室都打得不好
Segment #20  [00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,880] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就会变得非常痛苦
Segment #21  [00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,960] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 8  | Text: 只要站在现在的角度
Segment #22  [00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,660] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 你去看过去
Segment #23  [00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,200] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 为什么这个月业业绩不好
Segment #24  [00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,060] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 1  | Text: 你看
Segment #25  [00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,840] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 全部是交流
Segment #26  [00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,620] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 全部是问题
Segment #27  [00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,460] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 但换了方式
Segment #28  [00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:52,920] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 我想重新问你了
Segment #29  [00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,120] | Elapsed:  24.91s | Words: 10 | Text: 会议是怎么样能变得更干净
Segment #30  [00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,660] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 我问的这个问题
Segment #31  [00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,880] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 是过去还是未来
Segment #32  [00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,200] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 2  | Text: 未来
Segment #33  [00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:00,820] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 是未来
Segment #34  [00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,740] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 我们眼中所有的都是解决方
Segment #35  [00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,880] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 你看我现在在问一个问题
Segment #36  [00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:06,360] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 我刚才问
Segment #37  [00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:08,460] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 我说为什么我们这个月业业绩不好
Segment #38  [00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:09,160] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 3  | Text: 或者说为什么
Segment #39  [00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:12,560] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 上个月你们这个团队不努力
Segment #40  [00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:15,100] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 全部是问的过去
Segment #41  [00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,260] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 换了方式问的
Segment #42  [00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:16,520] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 2  | Text: 我说
Segment #43  [00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,840] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 下一步你们这个团队
Segment #44  [00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,140] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 该怎么样越来越好
Segment #45  [00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:22,400] | Elapsed:  39.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 我只要站在现在的角度
Segment #46  [00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,000] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 给你看过来
Segment #47  [00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,680] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 那全部是解决方案
Segment #48  [00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,040] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #49  [00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,500] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 你把视频拍好了
Segment #50  [00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,920] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 我不是给老天看了
Segment #51  [00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:30,720] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 这话说给你的
Segment #52  [00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:31,980] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 不要过来聊问题
Segment #53  [00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,040] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 不要过来聊解决方案
Segment #54  [00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,320] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 以后你也不要站在
Segment #55  [00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,700] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 现在看过去
Segment #56  [00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,160] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后现在是站在现在看未来
Segment #57  [00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,220] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 还有一个点
Segment #58  [00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:43,200] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 我这个给老天看过一下
Segment #59  [00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,720] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 你永远不要跟一个
Segment #60  [00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,960] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 不懂得管理的人去
Segment #61  [00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,660] | Elapsed:  53.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 聊怎么管理
Segment #62  [00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:51,620] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 你也不要给你一个
Segment #63  [00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,940] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 脑子里没有梦想的人
Segment #64  [00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:54,600] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 去聊未来
Segment #65  [00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:55,240] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 谈梦想
Segment #66  [00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,760] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 你也永远不要跟一个
Segment #67  [00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,680] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 拦多的人去聊
Segment #68  [00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,120] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 早起的女儿有虫磁
Segment #69  [00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:01,740] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 人只有塞血
Segment #70  [00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:03,640] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 2  | Text: 听好了
Segment #71  [00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,480] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 只有塞血
Segment #72  [00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:05,880] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有培养
Segment #73  [00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,760] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 最后一句话你们吸品
Segment #74  [00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,800] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是合适的人
Segment #75  [00:02:09,940 --> 00:02:11,320] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 你把他放在哪个岗位
Segment #76  [00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,420] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 视频都会发光
Segment #77  [00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:13,480] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 不合适的人
Segment #78  [00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,280] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 你给他调个岗
Segment #79  [00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:14,980] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 换个行业
Segment #80  [00:02:14,980 --> 00:02:16,260] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 换个岗位
Segment #81  [00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:17,560] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 他也做不成事
Segment #82  [00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:17,940] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #83  [00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,500] | Elapsed:  70.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 骨子里就不对路
Segment #84  [00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:21,760] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 4  | Text: 老铁明你看
Segment #85  [00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:22,960] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们现在看我的问题
Segment #86  [00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,780] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 是站在现在看未来
Segment #87  [00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,260] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 还是站在现在看过去
Segment #88  [00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,180] | Elapsed:  77.79s | Words: 2  | Text: 很重要
